e":"kt","d":"2020-02-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kyung-Keun Yoon","x":"Also we will avoid some competition based on cost and tariff for the existing telecom business and endeavor to improve both growth and profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/kt-corp-kt-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q1","e":"kt","d":"2020-05-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Kyung-Keun Yoon","x":"…Plus, the new tariff plan with a variety of content benefits for video, music, VR and etc., have been positively received with more than half of new 5G subscribers opting for this plan. [Foreign Speech] Also the 5G streaming game service currently in open beta, has surpassed 40,000 subscribers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/kt-corp-kt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q1","e":"kt","d":"2020-05-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Kyung-Keun Yoon","x":"…interest with the launch of the Korea's first 4K wireless VR service in 2019, showcased the 8K VR streaming for the first time in the world. With the COVID-19 affecting outdoor activities, March's monthly usage volume increased by 60% and per subscriber average usage time increased by 20% as…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/kt-corp-kt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q1","e":"kt","d":"2020-05-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kyung-Keun Yoon","x":"Since starting the world's first 5G service in April 2019, as we enter the second year, we have 1.780 million 5G subscribers. [Foreign Speech] KT has been leading the market with innovative tariff plans.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/kt-corp-kt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q1","e":"kt","d":"2020-05-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kyung-Keun Yoon","x":"And in the first quarter, we have expanded our 5G age group, with the launch of the 5G Y Teen [Phonetic] tariff plan for the teens and the Y Super Plan for the 20 [Phonetic].","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/kt-corp-kt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q2","e":"kt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Yoon Kyung-Keun","x":"For us, we will focus on introducing competitive tariff plans and also launch cloud streaming games.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/korean-telco-kt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q2","e":"kt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yoon Kyung-Keun","x":"Despite formidable business environment, we saw robust subscriber growth from our core telecom business and achieved high revenue growth from the AI and DX businesses, including cloud, data center and blockchain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/korean-telco-kt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q2","e":"kt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yoon Kyung-Keun","x":"KT's network and digital strength, spanning 5G, AI, big data, cloud make up our core infrastructure and platform in the post COVID world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/korean-telco-kt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q2","e":"kt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yoon Kyung-Keun","x":"During the corp day, corporate day, CEO also talk to the effect about the restructuring of our group companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/korean-telco-kt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q2","e":"kt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yoon Kyung-Keun","x":"I think we mentioned this previously as well, but the company, in light of our strategic value, we will be quite bold in restructuring our affiliates and subsidiaries that does not -- that do not add to our growth or that do not create synergies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/korean-telco-kt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q3","e":"kt","d":"2020-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kyung-Keun Yoon","x":"…[Foreign language] Due to distinct DX platform, underpinned by the so-called ABC, which stands for AI, Big Data and cloud, and KT'S network infrastructure prowess, we will be a digital innovation partner to companies, helping them grow and accelerate digital transformation for Korea as a nation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/09/korean-telco-kt-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q3","e":"kt","d":"2020-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kyung-Keun Yoon","x":"As of Q3, there was 2,810,000 5G subscribers, accounting for 20% of the handset subscribers. [Foreign language] Following the Super Plan choice plan, we introduced mid- to low-end tariff plan in October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/09/korean-telco-kt-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q3","e":"kt","d":"2020-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kyung-Keun Yoon","x":"But having said that, if you look at the October figures, there has been some increase in the percentage of subscribers taking out this mid- to low-end tariff plan below KRW 80,000.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/09/korean-telco-kt-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q4","e":"kt","d":"2021-02-09","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Hoi Jae Kim","x":"And with the launch of the lower-end 5G tariff plan, there are some concerns that this may actually curb the ARPU growth, so in light of the marketing backdrop, could you share with us what your ARPU outlook is?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/kt-corporation-kt-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q4","e":"kt","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kim Young-jin","x":"Second, in order to gain ground for platform business development, we plan to accelerate group portfolio restructuring around -- mainly around growth businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/kt-corporation-kt-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2020 Q4","e":"kt","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kim Young-jin","x":"B2B IT and solutions business showed slight contraction on the back of subdued global SI business, following COVID-19 pandemic, and restructuring of low-margin businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/kt-corporation-kt-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2021 Q1","e":"kt","d":"2021-05-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kim Young-Jin","x":"And by introducing a flat-rate tariff product, we were able to further slow down or stabilize that decline in home telephony. [Foreign language] Next question, please.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/kt-corporation-kt-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2021 Q2","e":"kt","d":"2021-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Young-jin Kim","x":"We will also continue to carry out restructuring or reorganization of the group.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/10/kt-corporation-kt-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2021 Q3","e":"kt","d":"2021-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Young-Jin Kim","x":"…broadband Internet business also saw a sustained subscriber expansion. [Foreign language] Restructuring of the group business geared toward digico transformation is also ongoing, which drove a significant rise in both revenue and profit of group affiliates. [Foreign language] K Bank,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/kt-corporation-kt-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2022 Q1","e":"kt","d":"2022-05-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Seung-Hoon Chi","x":"…KT offers customized services to different industries based on Korea's largest mobile and fixed infrastructure, strength in core DX technologies such as AI, big data and cloud, and our diverse corporate product portfolio, which led to a 10.5% Y-o-Y growth for DIGICO B2B and a 7.1% Y-o-Y growth…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/12/korean-telco-kt-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2022 Q2","e":"kt","d":"2022-08-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kim Young-Jin","x":"And in June, in order to satisfy wide-ranging content demand from our users and to offer more choice, we revamped the tariff plan into the Choice plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/11/korean-telco-kt-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2022 Q2","e":"kt","d":"2022-08-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kim Young-Jin","x":"So just to remind you that we have a 5G mid-priced tariff scheme upcoming in the near future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/11/korean-telco-kt-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2026 Q3","e":"kt","d":"2026-11-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bong-Gyun Kim","x":"And through the collaboration with KT Cloud, we are building upon the order pipeline for AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/kt-corp-kt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KT 2026 Q3","e":"kt","d":"2026-11-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bong-Gyun Kim","x":"We are also speeding up efforts to beef up KT's competitiveness in AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/kt-corp-kt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[40,1,3560,0,0,0,2782,471],[41,1,3533,0,0,0,2720,529],[42,1,4649,0,0,0,3614,434],[43,1,3699,0,0,0,3099,366],[44,1,5047,0,0,0,4005,700],[45,1,3907,0,0,0,3114,306],[46,1,5053,0,0,0,4311,488],[47,1,3963,0,0,0,3286,371],[49,1,3422,0,0,0,1586,1569],[50,1,3880,0,0,0,3239,444